WEBVTT

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:41.791
My true power has been unleashed,

00:00:42.581 --> 00:00:45.331
yet you are still able to keep up.

00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:46.291
Yeah.

00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:49.421
You're pretty strong.

00:00:56.471 --> 00:00:59.481
Rebuilding City A might be impossible.

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:04.361
Well, right now I should focus on the battle.

00:01:04.361 --> 00:01:09.401
She may be rank 2 or whatever,
but I can't leave it all to one little girl.

00:01:09.401 --> 00:01:13.411
I've got my own anti-aircraft measures.

00:01:13.411 --> 00:01:14.581
Like this!

00:01:22.421 --> 00:01:23.291
Hey!

00:01:24.531 --> 00:01:25.911
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.251
This area's got some nice rubble.

00:01:29.581 --> 00:01:32.001
Hurry up and get out of my way.

00:01:32.001 --> 00:01:34.301
H-Her psychic power is this strong?!

00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:36.591
I give up!

00:01:46.971 --> 00:01:48.931
We're under attack again!

00:01:48.931 --> 00:01:50.231
R-Return fire!

00:01:50.231 --> 00:01:52.481
The guns are wrecked!

00:01:52.481 --> 00:01:54.481
Seriously?! We're dead meat!

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.361
This planet's too tough!

00:01:56.361 --> 00:01:58.611
Lord Boros!

00:01:58.611 --> 00:02:01.371
I wanna go home…

00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:07.001
Such incredible power.

00:02:07.581 --> 00:02:10.041
Tatsumaki may actually bring it down on her own.

00:02:10.661 --> 00:02:12.211
I have errands to run.

00:02:12.211 --> 00:02:14.001
I will head out now.

00:02:14.581 --> 00:02:17.091
Things appear to be under control.

00:02:17.091 --> 00:02:18.711
Sure, go ahead.

00:02:18.711 --> 00:02:20.971
Some of us have already left.

00:02:21.671 --> 00:02:25.341
Before I go, Genos, do you have a moment?

00:02:25.341 --> 00:02:27.021
There's something I wish to tell you.

00:02:27.021 --> 00:02:30.481
Class S rank 9, Drive Knight.

00:02:30.481 --> 00:02:31.901
I don't think we're acquainted.

00:02:33.231 --> 00:02:36.901
Listen. Metal Knight is your enemy.

00:02:37.771 --> 00:02:39.151
Be careful.

00:02:39.691 --> 00:02:40.901
What do you mean?

00:02:41.491 --> 00:02:42.651
You'll know soon enough.

00:02:43.151 --> 00:02:46.411
But for now, keep your distance.

00:03:05.931 --> 00:03:06.931
Bastard.

00:03:06.931 --> 00:03:09.931
You sure keep things interesting.

00:03:11.311 --> 00:03:13.431
I'm beginning to taste victory.

00:03:15.731 --> 00:03:17.441
The stiffness in my shoulders is gone.

00:03:17.441 --> 00:03:20.481
Guess I'm a little rusty.

00:03:20.481 --> 00:03:21.981
You're still ali—?

00:03:21.981 --> 00:03:22.321
Hey.

00:03:23.491 --> 00:03:24.701
Forgetting someone?

00:03:25.831 --> 00:03:28.711
Atomic Slash

00:03:27.281 --> 00:03:29.581
Atomic Slash!

00:03:30.951 --> 00:03:32.331
Insolence…

00:03:32.701 --> 00:03:34.831
Such utter insolence!

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:40.591
You move your heart-thing inside your body to hide its location.

00:03:40.591 --> 00:03:48.011
But your regeneration always begins
with your head, and in the center lies…

00:03:48.011 --> 00:03:49.141
your heart.

00:03:49.141 --> 00:03:52.721
After seeing it so many times, even a monkey'd figure it out.

00:03:53.141 --> 00:03:54.731
See? Checkmate.

00:03:54.731 --> 00:03:57.271
No!

00:04:01.271 --> 00:04:02.401
Bang!

00:04:02.821 --> 00:04:04.901
All I needed was one more swing.

00:04:05.281 --> 00:04:08.911
Keep your hands to yourself, Silverfang.

00:04:09.201 --> 00:04:13.411
Goodness, I really do need to do more full-body workouts.

00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:16.411
We got all the heads.

00:04:17.501 --> 00:04:20.301
That means… victory is ours!

00:04:20.921 --> 00:04:23.801
Yeah, but there's still that big-ass ship up there.

00:04:28.131 --> 00:04:32.141
All right, that's the last of the reported survivors.

00:04:32.641 --> 00:04:33.851
Let's move!

00:04:33.851 --> 00:04:34.521
Right.

00:04:40.311 --> 00:04:41.281
Mumen!

00:04:41.611 --> 00:04:43.361
Quit your staring and come on!

00:04:43.941 --> 00:04:45.741
Yeah, okay.

00:05:40.081 --> 00:05:41.831
Nice moves.

00:05:41.831 --> 00:05:43.711
As I thought, you are strong.

00:05:43.711 --> 00:05:47.301
Of all the myriad beings I have fought,

00:05:47.921 --> 00:05:49.801
you alone have been able to match me!

00:05:55.221 --> 00:05:59.181
Now to release the destructive energy held within me!

00:06:00.311 --> 00:06:03.771
Any normal creature hit by it would find even their bones vaporized!

00:06:15.781 --> 00:06:17.541
Behind you!

00:06:26.751 --> 00:06:28.171
You were a worthy opponent,

00:06:29.171 --> 00:06:32.931
but the outcome of this battle is clear.

00:06:33.471 --> 00:06:38.561
In the struggle to survive in our home world's harsh environment, my species came out on top.

00:06:39.311 --> 00:06:42.941
Our regenerative abilities are unmatched.

00:06:42.941 --> 00:06:45.561
I, in particular, have self-healing power,

00:06:45.561 --> 00:06:50.111
physical prowess, and latent energy
beyond your comprehension.

00:06:50.111 --> 00:06:54.741
A deep wound that would be fatal for you
heals itself on me in mere moments.

00:06:54.741 --> 00:06:57.531
By focusing all my energy on my destroyed arm,

00:06:57.531 --> 00:07:00.961
I can explosively speed up the healing process.

00:07:01.961 --> 00:07:03.751
Good as new.

00:07:03.751 --> 00:07:07.331
You, on the other hand,
will only continue to accumulate injuries,

00:07:07.331 --> 00:07:08.921
all while slowly losing stamina—

00:07:08.921 --> 00:07:09.711
Shut up.

00:07:11.761 --> 00:07:14.011
Blah, blah, blah.

00:07:14.011 --> 00:07:15.381
Are you done?

00:07:16.141 --> 00:07:17.181
Is that all you've got?

00:07:23.181 --> 00:07:24.401
Not at all!

00:07:33.651 --> 00:07:36.531
Meteoric Burst!

00:08:00.141 --> 00:08:03.931
The energy shunted from my body transforms into a propelling force,

00:08:05.181 --> 00:08:08.151
elevating speed and power to
a level beyond the limitations…

00:08:10.071 --> 00:08:12.191
of living flesh!

00:09:07.161 --> 00:09:12.251
Doing this places tremendous stress on my body,
much like anaerobic exercise.

00:09:12.251 --> 00:09:14.761
As a result, it shortens my life.

00:09:15.091 --> 00:09:19.091
Therefore, it should only be used as a trump card for settling fights quickly.

00:09:26.181 --> 00:09:27.311
It's moving!

00:09:28.641 --> 00:09:30.271
You're doing it!

00:09:30.271 --> 00:09:32.401
Awesome, Tatsumaki!

00:09:42.111 --> 00:09:42.911
Oh.

00:09:45.031 --> 00:09:46.331
I made it!

00:09:49.621 --> 00:09:51.001
This man…

00:09:53.131 --> 00:09:56.711
makes me want to go all out!

00:10:16.191 --> 00:10:17.941
That's it, Saitama.

00:10:18.571 --> 00:10:20.701
You are indeed worth defeating!

00:10:21.701 --> 00:10:23.951
Consecutive Normal Punches.

00:10:33.961 --> 00:10:36.421
I will defeat you!

00:10:39.131 --> 00:10:46.641
All my energy will be released,
blasting you and this planet to Hell!

00:10:54.941 --> 00:10:58.941
Collapsing Star, Roaring Cannon!

00:11:01.401 --> 00:11:04.281
In that case, I'm using my final move too.

00:11:04.781 --> 00:11:06.531
Killer Move: Serious Series…

00:11:07.241 --> 00:11:08.831
Serious Punch.

00:11:39.151 --> 00:11:42.401
Did I… lose?

00:11:43.741 --> 00:11:45.401
You're still conscious?

00:11:46.911 --> 00:11:49.621
You really are strong.

00:11:49.621 --> 00:11:51.291
The prophecy held true.

00:11:51.911 --> 00:11:55.421
The battle was… hard-fought.

00:11:56.421 --> 00:11:58.791
Yeah. It sure was.

00:12:02.841 --> 00:12:04.181
You lie.

00:12:04.971 --> 00:12:07.051
You had strength to spare.

00:12:08.091 --> 00:12:10.801
I never stood a chance.

00:12:10.801 --> 00:12:14.641
It wasn't even a battle.

00:12:17.191 --> 00:12:19.941
So much for prophecies.

00:12:20.691 --> 00:12:23.481
You were too strong…

00:12:28.031 --> 00:12:29.531
Saitama…

00:12:34.711 --> 00:12:39.211
THE STRONGEST HERO

00:12:47.931 --> 00:12:48.971
It's coming down?

00:12:49.761 --> 00:12:51.471
Is this Master's doing?

00:12:53.101 --> 00:12:55.721
We're done for! The power sphere's been broken!

00:12:55.721 --> 00:12:56.851
We're going down!

00:12:56.851 --> 00:12:59.141
Lord Boros went wild!

00:12:59.141 --> 00:13:00.601
Get out, get out!

00:13:00.601 --> 00:13:01.271
Run!

00:13:01.271 --> 00:13:02.481
Stop shoving, stupid!

00:13:02.481 --> 00:13:06.241
I wanna go home, Mommy!

00:13:07.241 --> 00:13:08.031
It's coming down.

00:13:08.031 --> 00:13:08.491
Huh?

00:13:09.241 --> 00:13:11.241
Hey, we better get outta here!

00:13:11.241 --> 00:13:13.031
This is bad.

00:13:13.031 --> 00:13:15.041
Run for the Association HQ.

00:13:15.041 --> 00:13:17.001
Iai! Hold on to me!

00:13:17.001 --> 00:13:18.381
I'm okay, Master!

00:13:18.791 --> 00:13:21.881
Damn. How'd Silverfang get so fast?

00:13:21.881 --> 00:13:24.171
Now's not the time to be competitive.

00:13:24.171 --> 00:13:25.841
Angel Dash!

00:13:25.841 --> 00:13:27.921
Hey pansy, don't you run in front of me!

00:13:27.921 --> 00:13:28.761
You're too slow!

00:13:28.761 --> 00:13:30.181
Angel Dash!

00:13:30.181 --> 00:13:33.011
Don't just say it, move!

00:13:33.011 --> 00:13:36.521
We're gonna crash!

00:13:46.151 --> 00:13:47.651
It's down.

00:13:47.651 --> 00:13:49.031
All right, let's go.

00:14:12.131 --> 00:14:15.061
How did City A end up like this?

00:14:15.061 --> 00:14:18.811
Class A, Rank 1
Handsomely Masked Amai Mask

00:14:15.801 --> 00:14:18.351
All of Class S was meeting today…

00:14:22.941 --> 00:14:25.861
Care to explain, Metal Bat?

00:14:25.861 --> 00:14:26.441
Huh?

00:14:26.821 --> 00:14:29.201
Explain it so I can understand.

00:14:29.821 --> 00:14:32.201
Handsomely Masked Amai Mask…

00:14:32.741 --> 00:14:35.201
Where the hell'd you pop up from?

00:14:35.821 --> 00:14:38.581
I was filming a TV drama in the next town.

00:14:39.541 --> 00:14:41.621
There was a roar and tremors,

00:14:41.621 --> 00:14:45.501
so I came to investigate
and found City A wiped out.

00:14:46.171 --> 00:14:49.011
Monsters on a huge-ass ship attacked us.

00:14:49.761 --> 00:14:52.471
They fired artillery at us and did all this.

00:14:52.471 --> 00:14:54.261
But we took care of it.

00:14:56.051 --> 00:14:58.891
"Took care of it," you say?

00:14:59.431 --> 00:15:01.481
You call this victory?

00:15:02.311 --> 00:15:04.101
Such incompetence!

00:15:04.101 --> 00:15:07.311
I'm completely appalled at all of you!

00:15:07.311 --> 00:15:07.981
Hey.

00:15:08.571 --> 00:15:12.111
You didn't even get here in time,
so don't get all high and mighty.

00:15:12.951 --> 00:15:15.781
It's true I didn't make it in time,

00:15:15.781 --> 00:15:17.871
but you were all right here.

00:15:18.621 --> 00:15:21.121
You didn't save a single brick!

00:15:21.121 --> 00:15:24.881
We were having a meeting
inside the headquarters building.

00:15:25.461 --> 00:15:28.421
We went outside as soon as the enemy attacked,

00:15:28.421 --> 00:15:30.761
but the city was already in ruins.

00:15:31.261 --> 00:15:33.131
So what?

00:15:33.131 --> 00:15:36.801
You think if you tell them that,
the media will just let all this slide?

00:15:36.801 --> 00:15:37.761
You…

00:15:38.261 --> 00:15:40.141
Whose side are you on?

00:15:40.141 --> 00:15:42.271
We did our best.

00:15:43.141 --> 00:15:45.521
I'm on the side of justice.

00:15:46.521 --> 00:15:49.771
Having S-class heroes this pathetic…

00:15:51.611 --> 00:15:52.951
is an embarrassment.

00:15:53.361 --> 00:15:56.701
Anybody this useless should voluntarily retire.

00:15:57.161 --> 00:16:00.081
Hey! Don't give us that crap!

00:16:00.911 --> 00:16:04.331
Who's gonna care about a pop idol
with a busted-up face?!

00:16:04.961 --> 00:16:08.251
Do you have any idea why
I don't move up to Class S?

00:16:08.251 --> 00:16:13.551
I stay at the top of Class A to stop weak, good-for-nothing pissants like you

00:16:13.551 --> 00:16:16.091
from ever getting into Class S.

00:16:28.481 --> 00:16:33.031
Metal Knight, you skip the meeting
and only show up now?

00:16:37.741 --> 00:16:38.741
This is…

00:16:39.281 --> 00:16:40.991
magnificent.

00:16:40.991 --> 00:16:42.371
Metal Knight!

00:16:42.991 --> 00:16:44.751
What are you doing here?

00:16:45.451 --> 00:16:47.381
The battle is already over.

00:16:48.171 --> 00:16:51.171
Metal Knight is your enemy.

00:16:51.841 --> 00:16:53.341
Genos, right?

00:16:53.341 --> 00:16:56.091
Don't tell me you've come to recover the spaceship.

00:16:56.631 --> 00:17:01.391
Are you here so you can create more
powerful weapons with the alien technology?

00:17:01.391 --> 00:17:02.681
Precisely.

00:17:03.351 --> 00:17:05.311
Powerful weapons are a necessity…

00:17:06.351 --> 00:17:08.311
for the sake of peace.

00:17:10.271 --> 00:17:12.441
Even with powerful weapons,

00:17:12.441 --> 00:17:14.981
in the hands of heroes like these, they'd be wasted.

00:17:14.981 --> 00:17:18.451
You're mine later, pretty boy.
Watch your ass.

00:17:18.451 --> 00:17:19.911
Hey!

00:17:19.911 --> 00:17:21.951
I found some alien survivors!

00:17:25.661 --> 00:17:28.291
I can't believe Lord Boros actually lost.

00:17:28.291 --> 00:17:30.171
Are we going to be killed?

00:17:30.171 --> 00:17:32.341
Maybe we can talk our way out of this.

00:17:32.631 --> 00:17:35.341
Ah, I'm so hungry!

00:17:35.341 --> 00:17:37.551
You idiot! Now's not the time for—

00:17:38.471 --> 00:17:40.471
Shh! Someone's coming.

00:17:48.351 --> 00:17:50.811
Amai Mask! What the—?

00:17:50.811 --> 00:17:53.531
They did not deserve to live.
They were evil.

00:17:54.191 --> 00:17:57.111
I swiftly delivered justice, that's all.

00:17:58.651 --> 00:17:59.991
I'm sure you understand,

00:18:00.651 --> 00:18:01.661
Genos…

00:18:02.411 --> 00:18:04.241
You've been busy since the exam.

00:18:04.241 --> 00:18:06.621
But from what I saw of the
Deep Sea King incident and today,

00:18:07.701 --> 00:18:09.881
you've mostly been a disappointment.

00:18:13.381 --> 00:18:14.581
Best leave it.

00:18:14.581 --> 00:18:16.631
Do not worry. I am fine.

00:18:18.051 --> 00:18:20.891
He reminds me of how I was before I met Master.

00:18:22.221 --> 00:18:23.841
A man on edge,

00:18:24.391 --> 00:18:27.061
too eager to eliminate evil.

00:18:27.061 --> 00:18:31.311
Just like me, he must have gone through
something terrible in his past.

00:18:32.641 --> 00:18:33.601
Wait!

00:18:33.601 --> 00:18:34.901
Where's Master?

00:18:47.371 --> 00:18:49.041
Oh, I'm out!

00:18:50.251 --> 00:18:51.541
Hey!

00:18:51.541 --> 00:18:54.881
Why would a B-class like you be inside the ship?

00:18:54.881 --> 00:18:55.961
Master!

00:18:57.091 --> 00:18:58.381
You are safe!

00:18:58.381 --> 00:18:59.671
Hey, Genos!

00:18:59.671 --> 00:19:01.171
We're done here. Let's go.

00:19:01.171 --> 00:19:03.381
Did you defeat their leader?

00:19:03.381 --> 00:19:06.091
Yeah, he was really strong.

00:19:06.091 --> 00:19:07.351
Maybe the strongest I've faced.

00:19:07.351 --> 00:19:08.601
I see.

00:19:08.601 --> 00:19:11.231
So without you, Master, the prophecy…

00:19:11.771 --> 00:19:14.351
about Earth's destruction would have come true.

00:19:12.641 --> 00:19:14.351
They're ignoring me?

00:19:14.351 --> 00:19:15.151
Nah.

00:19:15.151 --> 00:19:18.271
Turns out you can't trust prophecies to begin with.

00:19:18.271 --> 00:19:19.821
Hold it right there!

00:19:20.481 --> 00:19:23.651
I don't know how you did it,
but you went in the ship on your own?

00:19:23.651 --> 00:19:25.661
You're just a B-class.
How dare you butt in like that?

00:19:25.661 --> 00:19:28.281
I didn't need you!
I could have handled it on my own!

00:19:28.281 --> 00:19:30.241
Baldy! Octopus! Boiled egg! Light bulb! Avocado!

00:19:30.241 --> 00:19:32.831
Lame face! Goblin! Bug! Baldy!

00:19:31.581 --> 00:19:32.831
G-Genos.

00:19:32.831 --> 00:19:34.081
Table tennis ball! Rice grain! Beanhead!

00:19:32.831 --> 00:19:34.081
Say something.

00:19:34.081 --> 00:19:34.711
Yes, sir.

00:19:34.081 --> 00:19:35.871
Kettle! Baldy! Kneecap!

00:19:35.871 --> 00:19:37.091
Listen, spoiled brat.

00:19:37.631 --> 00:19:39.961
Shut up and get lost,
or get beat down.

00:19:39.961 --> 00:19:40.751
That's it! Yeah!

00:19:43.881 --> 00:19:46.431
Unforgivable. Me, a brat?

00:19:46.431 --> 00:19:48.101
I'm older than you!

00:19:48.721 --> 00:19:49.891
Genos?!

00:19:49.891 --> 00:19:52.221
You're next, B-class!

00:19:52.221 --> 00:19:53.731
That's enough, Tatsumaki.

00:19:54.521 --> 00:19:57.651
Are you not a member of the Hero Association?

00:19:59.901 --> 00:20:01.321
Whatever.

00:20:02.651 --> 00:20:06.821
Why are the elite heroes all so difficult?

00:20:06.821 --> 00:20:10.741
Genos, your joints are all bent the wrong way.

00:20:10.741 --> 00:20:12.661
Here, I'll fix you up.

00:20:12.661 --> 00:20:15.331
Oh, sorry, your arm came off.

00:20:15.331 --> 00:20:17.421
My back is killing me.

00:20:20.001 --> 00:20:23.181
City A was wiped off the map that day.

00:20:24.171 --> 00:20:27.301
The arrival of aliens and City A’s annihilation

00:20:27.301 --> 00:20:29.971
were historic events,
making the headlines for days.

00:20:30.601 --> 00:20:36.271
But eventually, the coverage died down, and
everyone forgot about the city that disappeared.

00:20:33.231 --> 00:20:37.531
CITY A DESTROYED

00:20:33.231 --> 00:20:37.531
ALIEN INVASION

00:20:38.481 --> 00:20:41.061
Metal Knight salvaged the spaceship.

00:20:41.061 --> 00:20:45.531
Soon thereafter, the Hero Association HQ
was reconstructed all the stronger,

00:20:45.531 --> 00:20:47.621
and became an impenetrable steel fortress.

00:20:48.661 --> 00:20:53.031
The infrastructure was rebuilt
with new roads leading out of HQ.

00:20:53.031 --> 00:20:56.371
Heroes were able to deploy quickly to every city.

00:20:56.961 --> 00:21:02.711
And heroes in Class A and above were
given the option to live at headquarters.

00:21:03.621 --> 00:21:15.421
With sadness in my embrace, I ride the wind to tomorrow

00:21:03.621 --> 00:21:15.421
ashita eno kaze ni notte kanashimitachi wo dakishimete

00:21:15.421 --> 00:21:21.341
Don't worry, just rest for a while

00:21:15.421 --> 00:21:21.341
daijoubu sukoshi yasumou

00:21:21.341 --> 00:21:25.931
Then we can move forward again

00:21:21.341 --> 00:21:25.931
soshite mata susumou

00:21:26.601 --> 00:21:32.121
The world will keep on turning,

00:21:26.601 --> 00:21:32.121
sekai wa mawaritsudzukete

00:21:32.621 --> 00:21:37.561
and with time we all experience pain we'll never forget

00:21:32.621 --> 00:21:37.561
yagate kienu itami wo shiru

00:21:37.561 --> 00:21:43.841
But for now, close your eyes

00:21:37.561 --> 00:21:43.841
soredemo ima me wo tojite

00:21:45.071 --> 00:21:50.301
and your memories will become smiles

00:21:45.071 --> 00:21:50.301
omoide ga hohoemi ni kawaru

00:21:51.081 --> 00:21:56.271
Hope is the key

00:21:51.081 --> 00:21:56.271
kibou ga sore wo kanaeru

00:21:57.091 --> 00:22:07.521
The sun sets of its own accord, ushering in sleep

00:21:57.091 --> 00:22:07.521
itsunomanika hi ga katamukeba nemuri ni tsutsumarete

00:22:09.121 --> 00:22:14.631
Memories, become my smile

00:22:09.121 --> 00:22:14.631
omoide yo hohoemi ni kaware

00:22:15.481 --> 00:22:24.271
Just keep those first precious memories

00:22:15.481 --> 00:22:24.271
deaeta yorokobi dake taisetsu ni shimattara

00:22:24.271 --> 00:22:33.421
Then gently wave goodbye

00:22:24.271 --> 00:22:33.421
sayonara sotto te wo furu yo

00:22:42.901 --> 00:22:44.151
You can see it clearly!

00:22:44.151 --> 00:22:46.901
The entire building has been ripped out,
right down to the foundations!

00:22:46.901 --> 00:22:50.611
Gargantuan Monster

00:22:46.901 --> 00:22:50.611
Moving from City Z towards City Y. Civilians are to evacuate.

00:22:47.321 --> 00:22:50.691
The monster appeared in City Z,
but now City Y is in—

00:22:59.411 --> 00:23:02.381
PLUTON
KING OF THE UNDERWORLD

00:23:04.251 --> 00:23:07.881
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON

00:23:08.801 --> 00:23:14.881
You humans waste your existence in gluttony,
littering the earth with worthless objects.

00:23:14.881 --> 00:23:19.761
Now you shall boil and rot in the depths of the underworld that spreads below my mighty snout!

00:23:22.811 --> 00:23:24.901
Who do we have here?

00:23:25.901 --> 00:23:29.151
A great man who is a hero for fun…

00:23:30.401 --> 00:23:31.281
and for profit.

00:23:31.281 --> 00:23:32.821
A great man?

00:23:41.291 --> 00:23:43.041
And his apprentice.

00:23:50.051 --> 00:23:52.801
Back to one punch again…

00:23:53.671 --> 00:23:57.931
God damn it!
